@@ -531,6 +531,21 @@ Standard Library Types Formatting
 * `std::variant <https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variant/variant>`_
 * `std::optional <https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/optional>`_
 
+``std::filesystem::path`` can be formatted with the ``g`` presentation type to
+use the generic format (forward slashes on all platforms) or ``n`` for the
+native format (the default):
+
+.. code-block:: C++
+
+   #include <fmt/std.h>
+
+   int main() {
+     std::filesystem::path filename = "C:/Users/zhihaoy/.cache";
+     fmt::print("|{}|", filename);  // prints |C:\Users\zhihaoy\.cache| on Windows
+     fmt::print("|{:n}|", filename);  // prints the native format
+     fmt::print("|{:g}|", filename);  // prints the generic format
+   }
+
 Formatting Variants
 -------------------
 
